OL,3,GNEWSADerelict building blaze forces    
OL,4,Acity centre road closures              
OL,6,FFire crews have tackled an early       
OL,7,Fmorning blaze at a derelict building in
OL,8,FDundee city centre.                    
OL,10,FEmergency services were alerted to a   
OL,11,Ffire in the open, on the corner of     
OL,12,FPanmure Street and St Andrews Street,  
OL,13,Fat 04:16.                              
OL,15,FThe Scottish Fire and Rescue Service   
OL,16,F(SFRS) said four appliances responded  
OL,17,Fto a blaze affecting a derelict        
OL,18,Fbuilding.                              
OL,20,FRoad closures are in place on St       
OL,21,FAndrew's Street, King Street and       
OL,22,FMurraygate.                            
